POWER BI MAP CONTEXT
  Road casements: Vicmap Property, (c) State of Victoria (DTP), CC BY 4.0 (site maps: the roads are cut out of the land so they show as paler streets).
  The Shape Maps in powerbi/ draw context round the buildings: City of Melbourne property boundaries (City of
  Melbourne Open Data, CC BY 4.0) and suburb boundaries (Australian Bureau of Statistics, ASGS Edition 3, Suburbs
  and Localities 2021, CC BY 4.0), cut to the map frame, and the school property outline from
  data/geometry/campus_site.geojson.

